      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is not"
      ],
      "reason": "The model incorrectly adds a branch after this condition to route to either 'Research schedule' or the end of the process. In the source, this specific condition strictly leads to 'Research schedule'. The model improperly merged different negative conditions here, altering the decision logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_i16->c_i8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Check if the ticket order is approved"
      ],
      "reason": "According to the source, if any of these ticket order checks are not approved, the process should end. The model incorrectly routes these negative outcomes backwards to the 'If it is not' node (c_i8) which handles schedule validation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_i20->c_i8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Check again if the ticket order is approved"
      ],
      "reason": "According to the source, if any of these ticket order checks are not approved, the process should end. The model incorrectly routes these negative outcomes backwards to the 'If it is not' node (c_i8) which handles schedule validation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_i21->c_i8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Check once more if the ticket order is approved"
      ],
      "reason": "According to the source, if any of these ticket order checks are not approved, the process should end. The model incorrectly routes these negative outcomes backwards to the 'If it is not' node (c_i8) which handles schedule validation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_i19->i20"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "validate the ticket order",
        "Check again if the ticket order is approved"
      ],
      "reason": "The source text describes a linear sequence of validating and checking the ticket multiple times. The model incorrectly transforms this sequence into a loop by routing the second check back to the first validation step (c_i18) and introducing an artificial branch (b_i19) to decide which check to execute next."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_i19->i21"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "validate the ticket order",
